      "question": "Which five machines are most likely to log more than 10 alarms over the next 30 days, and what plant and machine type is each?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T04:39:12.253725Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T04:39:38.718512Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Top 5 machines most likely to log >10 alarms in the next 30 days** (anchor 2026-10-01)\n\n| Rank | Machine ID | Probability | Plant | Machine Type |\n|------|------------|-------------|-------|--------------|\n| 1 | DAY-LTH-05 | 43.6% | DAY (Dayton) | CNC Lathe |\n| 2 | DAY-PRS-04 | 36.7% | DAY (Dayton) | Hydraulic Press |\n| 3 | BRN-LTH-04 | 35.4% | BRN (Brno) | CNC Lathe |\n| 4 | BRN-LTH-03 | 30.6% | BRN (Brno) | CNC Lathe |\n| 5 | DAY-MIL-02 | 29.9% | DAY (Dayton) | CNC Mill |\n\n[1] [2]\n\n**Notes**\n- Probabilities are from the Kumo “high alarm count in 30 days” template (binary classification: SUM of `alarm_count` > 10 over the next 30 days).\n- The model scored all 56 machines; the table shows the five highest probabilities.\n- Data is synthetic (Atlas Precision Components).\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] NVIDIA Kumo prediction result — high_alarm_count_30d — evidence `hermes-receipt:8139a372269866dd6d4903a72d7c02c49431efcaa9d1b75f6ed6dba73d2408d8`\n- [2] Structured retrieval result — manufacturing_operations — evidence `hermes-receipt:6b1b1df5a06be867752fa429e92de350a8e44e7e22a569f1c8ce54d6ff9012b0`",
